      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "となると、大地と一緒に\r\nこっちに落ちてきたってわけか。",
        "official_en": "So it must’ve been brought here along with the piece of Paladia that was pulled through the gate.",
        "real_en": "So it must have fallen here along with the land itself."
      },
