        "official_en_sha256": "f0c4791a24ea2078dc09a98f9d7b2fc4ce85c695f60b5830157dac8b84fdd128"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水華がリヴァイアサンを操れたのも\r\n神器の力があってこそだしね。",
        "official_en": "Yes. You witnessed the power it possesses when Alluvion used it to manipulate Leviathan.",
        "real_en": "Water Bloom Veritas could only control Leviathan because of that artifact's power."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
