        "official_en_sha256": "85eaf36707f1d87928613c49a74519154e18db610d83638ea5617549017fb7e4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "相手は幻獣だろ……？\r\nやべえ代物だな、神器ってのは。",
        "official_en": "But that was an esper, not just some ordinary Joe... Man, how powerful is that thing?",
        "real_en": "But we're talking about an Eidolon here... That's one dangerous artifact."
      },
