        "official_en_sha256": "4c5eb777e4903a4ddffb37ecae0abb2bebdbca131e09b0a7a0bc543b4c89ee1f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "自分の人格を変える魔法を強化して\r\n他者にかけられるようにしたのよ。",
        "official_en": "She used it to amplify a magic that alters the caster’s personality so that it could be cast on another—in Alluvion’s case, Leviathan.",
        "real_en": "She strengthened the spell that changes her own personality so she could cast it on others."
      },
